  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forum Mulher is sending two delegates to the portuguesespeaking countries org CPLP first conference for women with the issues gender, culture, access to power, political participation and development. The conference takes place in Salvador in Brazil Jan 30 - Febr 2000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forum Mulher ska s&#xe4;nda tv&#xe5; delegater till de portugisisktalande l&#xe4;ndernas sammanslutning CPLP:s f&#xf6;rsta konferens f&#xf6;r kvinnor med temat Gender, Kultur tillg&#xe5;ng till makt,politiskt deltagande och utveckling. Konferensen &#xe4;ger rum i Salvador i Brasilien 30 jan-1febr 2000.</narrative>
  </description>
